# Keep the build context small and never ship host state into the image.
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
.turbo
**/.turbo
dist
**/dist
work
coverage
# Database dumps. Gitignored, but Docker's context does not read .gitignore, so without
# this line they are baked into the image along with every user row and session token.
backups
**/coverage
apps/web/.pglite
apps/web/data
brand
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env.local
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
